PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY
# CONTRACT PIP_THOUGHT_BALANCED_SEAM_V0_4
# Inputs are already phase transported, with one common sqrt(2)^depth denominator.
# Source owner supplies typed pair, orientation, references and depth.
OP AR SOURCE left.real
OP AI SOURCE left.imag
OP BR SOURCE right.real
OP BI SOURCE right.imag
OP D SOURCE left.depth
OP RD SOURCE right.depth
OP LC SOURCE left.scope
OP RC SOURCE right.scope
OP LREF SOURCE left.ref
OP RREF SOURCE right.ref
OP SEAM SOURCE seam.ref
OP PHASE SOURCE seam.phase_ref
OP DSAME IDENTITY D RD
OP CSAME IDENTITY LC RC
OP NBR DIFFERENCE 0 BR
OP NBI DIFFERENCE 0 BI
OP XR DIFFERENCE AR NBR
OP XI DIFFERENCE AI NBI
OP YR DIFFERENCE AR BR
OP YI DIFFERENCE AI BI
OP DEPTH DIFFERENCE D -1
OP BRIGHT COMPOSITION XR XI
OP DARK COMPOSITION YR YI
OP OUTPUT COMPOSITION BRIGHT DARK DEPTH
OP LINEAGE COMPOSITION LC SEAM PHASE LREF RREF D DEPTH
OP WITNESS COMPOSITION DSAME CSAME
EMIT OUTPUT
EMIT LINEAGE
EMIT WITNESS
